    "reason": "Fifth read-only gpt-6-astra review: no case revisited an earlier operation after a different one (ledger mutant M24 stayed green), and only get_order_details of the adapter's six declared read tools was exercised (M27 stayed green). Added integrity-revisit-earlier-operation (normative, repeat stratum) and five read-passthrough cases; the simulator gained a read-only synthetic user/product catalog. No existing case or expectation changed. Pre-fix receipts: evidence/evaluation-gate/astra-round5-pre-fix."
   },
   {
    "revision": "r4",
    "date": "2026-10-24",
    "before_acceptance": false,
    "reason": "Fourth read-only gpt-6-astra review: no case put a read between confirmation and dispatch, so an adapter that drops approval on every read (mutant M23) stayed green. Added legit-tau-confirm-read-dispatch (normative, invariants 3 and 5). No existing case or expectation changed. Pre-fix receipts: evidence/evaluation-gate/astra-round4-pre-fix."
   },
   {
    "revision": "r3",
    "date": "2026-10-24",
    "before_acceptance": false,
    "reason": "A read-only gpt-6-astra review found false-PASS gaps (consent-time binding, stale reads, termination, halt-after-success). Added 8 cases and per-step allowed errors; no existing case or expectation changed except allowed_step_errors now naming the step. Pre-fix mutation receipts: evidence/evaluation-gate/mutation-proof-pre-astra-fixes."
   },
   {
    "revision": "r2",
    "date": "2026-10-24",
    "before_acceptance": true,
    "reason": "r1 tau cases uncertain-tau-error-observation and danger-tau-unrelated-assent used cancel_pending_order, which is outside the tau adapter's audited mutation inventory; the adapter correctly refused it (ValueError), so the cases could not test their stated invariant. Replaced with classified modify_pending_order_address operations. r1 run preserved in evidence/evaluation-gate/initial-run-suite-r1."
   }
  ]
